            <div xml:id="m-c8a69b2d-7ebc-4ba6-8565-933baa2ac9e6">
              <lg xml:id="m-cad7ea75-0660-4c5f-9722-7baeadb22c9e">
                <l xml:id="m-6483dbcf-6fb0-476e-8987-9e9ff8948983" facs="#m-fb9865fb-cf6f-4641-9296-d9ee436b4829" label="text-like">The Holy Family.</l><l xml:id="m-796053f1-6e2d-4abe-bba0-2b11144d4f77" facs="#m-dde96612-4832-4698-96f3-7e21744c9bec" label="ambiguous">473</l><l xml:id="m-477a46c6-b667-4873-b563-808f5bff9fb2" facs="#m-0a7e56e0-3864-43fc-abb9-7b0ba0affd95" label="ambiguous">comm.)</l><l xml:id="m-8505a5d7-bb21-44d0-ae89-e015b71d1705" facs="#m-1ee725e8-f004-427e-9bc8-458636494ac7" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-dd9cc4bd-a66c-436b-82ce-88ac3259d62a" facs="#m-f7db0fcc-e796-4f70-a9b2-5f0a3b8ef368" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-30505ffc-5bfc-4385-9479-37bfb2fed420" facs="#m-ecc96c52-5849-4b4b-bde0-b2a25b7253ee" label="lyrics-like">Escén-dit Jé-sus “cum é¬ is,</l><l xml:id="m-ddb62d38-7657-4bb7-9ea2-774519a39dd7" facs="#m-a90436c3-3368-4e7a-9ee2-7f1dd6d56345" label="lyrics-like">et vé-nit Ná¬</l><l xml:id="m-47acab5f-9778-4429-b089-dcf822cfb80f" facs="#m-d34d9c60-98c5-491c-bc86-4bff91dc371b" label="lyrics-like">rat súb¬ di-tus sl-lis.</l><l xml:id="m-a8a88e9e-8a86-45a0-b774-432a64f0c873" facs="#m-af898b4a-2449-454e-8eac-0c58f1b621e3" label="lyrics-like">za-reth, et é¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5bb703d-f2d9-4700-9f36-04d133354169" facs="#m-7db1dbf5-a412-4294-8eec-e1c9595ba825" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-bb58dcdb-1194-45c3-8498-02fec626c650" facs="#m-8479d9c6-6d64-44a9-a9d5-1d416a1c53a4" label="lyrics-like">Uos caeléstibus réficis sacra-[ occurrénte gloriósa Virgine Matre</l><l xml:id="m-3b62ff50-b26d-473a-b08b-87fcf014d5f2" facs="#m-83e7b5e2-69b4-4006-a03d-d54412027ace" label="lyrics-like">U méntis, fac, Dómine Jesu, san-ltua cum beãto Joseph, per te in</l><l xml:id="m-de40bbb7-80e9-42ec-b7e6-9ebda973ef42" facs="#m-189cc463-44c7-41d9-bfbc-82dfc1322590" label="lyrics-like">ctae Familiae tuae exémpla júgiter ! aetérna tabernácula récipi mereá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4390a86d-3efb-4a92-8c98-bf42e43d4347" facs="#m-5b59bd83-b6